OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA motorist is stuck in his car,
OL,7,     Funable to move his legs, and may
OL,8,     Fhave suffered a serious spinal
OL,9,     Finjury. A man in a hard-to-reach
OL,10,     Frural location has cut his leg
OL,11,     Fwith an angle grinder.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FLanguage is a barrier in dealing
OL,14,     Fwith an aggressive male who claims
OL,15,     Fhe has been attacked. Children's
OL,16,     Fnurse Kiera treats an 11-year-old
OL,17,     Fwho stepped on glass and sliced
OL,18,     Fopen her foot.
